# PCA of forms of capital in 100-year slices — results

**Main specification:** `capital.csv`, 39 bins of 100 years (4300–500 BCE) x 12 capital variables (group/colour dropped), re-standardised (z-score) inside the matrix, SVD = correlation PCA. Axis signs set so the largest-|loading| variable of each component is positive.

