## The three symbolic components

| variable | loading PC1 | rank by abs PC1 | loading PC2 | rank by abs PC2 | r with PC1 score | r with PC2 score |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| House Size | +0.225 | 10/12 | +0.327 | 5/12 | +0.43 | +0.50 |
| Daggers | +0.266 | 6/12 | +0.074 | 10/12 | +0.51 | +0.11 |
| Hatchets & Swords | +0.299 | 5/12 | +0.054 | 12/12 | +0.57 | +0.08 |

Cosine similarity in the PC1–PC2 loading plane: Daggers/Hatchets&Swords = 0.996; House/Daggers = 0.767; House/Hatchets&Swords = 0.704.

Symbolic–symbolic correlations: House–Daggers r=0.44, Daggers–Hatchets r=0.35, House–Hatchets r=0.14.

Mean correlation with the 9 non-symbolic variables: House +0.186, Daggers +0.068, Hatchets&Swords +0.067; strongest single partner for House and Daggers is Copper & Gold (r=0.52 and 0.51).

